{"4085730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Curse of the Dragonbeast", "steam_appid": 4085730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curse of the Dragonbeast is A turn-based tactical RPG with Team Roguelike Loot - help your team find the best build. Choose from 20+ playable professions, master over 130 unique items, and outsmart your enemies in unpredictable hex-grid battles that reward adaptable strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5v5 matches on expansive hex-grid maps filled with forests, rivers, bushes and terrain that demand smart positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against challenging AI opponents in Solo or Co-Op. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ playable professions (with more planned), each with roles like Tank, Damage, Control, Support, and Healer. Synergize with your team for victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a unique build every match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your match length - 45 min full length matches or 15 min arena matches. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team Roguelike Loot - Hoard items to win</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share items with your team in a team-owned inventory. Store items for later or give them to teammates for big plays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield powerful Cursed and Holy items, but use them for too long and you will be consumed by their power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden item interactions that reward outside-the-box thinking.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Replayability</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapeshifting transformations and ever-changing items ensure no two matches are alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five game modes and 10+ maps to keep gameplay varied.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a new puzzle — experiment, adapt, and surprise your opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive future content plans.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE DEMO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is an early version. While fully playable, certain elements are still in development and may not reflect the final release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We invite you to join our Discord where you can help shape the game with us and participate in events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[]xxxxx[:::::::::::::::::::::::&gt;</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curse of the Dragonbeast is A turn-based tactical RPG with Team Roguelike Loot - help your team find the best build. Choose from 20+ playable professions, master over 130 unique items, and outsmart your enemies in unpredictable hex-grid battles that reward adaptable strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5v5 matches on expansive hex-grid maps filled with forests, rivers, bushes and terrain that demand smart positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against challenging AI opponents in Solo or Co-Op. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ playable professions (with more planned), each with roles like Tank, Damage, Control, Support, and Healer. Synergize with your team for victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a unique build every match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your match length - 45 min full length matches or 15 min arena matches. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team Roguelike Loot - Hoard items to win</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share items with your team in a team-owned inventory. Store items for later or give them to teammates for big plays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield powerful Cursed and Holy items, but use them for too long and you will be consumed by their power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden item interactions that reward outside-the-box thinking.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Replayability</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapeshifting transformations and ever-changing items ensure no two matches are alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five game modes and 10+ maps to keep gameplay varied.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a new puzzle — experiment, adapt, and surprise your opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive future content plans.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE DEMO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is an early version. While fully playable, certain elements are still in development and may not reflect the final release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We invite you to join our Discord where you can help shape the game with us and participate in events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[]xxxxx[:::::::::::::::::::::::&gt;</strong></p>", "short_description": "A turn-based tactical RPG with Team Roguelike Loot - help your team find the best build. Choose from 20+ playable professions, master over 130 unique items, and outsmart your enemies in unpredictable hex grid battles that reward adaptable strategy.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085730/d8bda412cd22dfc8d83e5adedc75a519ebd8ff56/header.jpg?t=1779851028", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085730/7d82c69efe9742493ad05186100c849b5e80cba4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779851028", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085730/7d